{"completed": true, "response": "{\"better\":\"Y\",\"regress\":\"有，Y个别段落的感受句堆得较密，扫到这些地方时不如X右侧短词那样一眼掠过。\",\"nets\":{\"scan\":\"Y\",\"point\":\"Y\",\"why\":\"Y\",\"whole\":\"Y\",\"fine\":\"Y\"},\"why\":\"Y把每段真正要抓的事压成很短的“话”，再用放大的关键词给眼睛落点，音乐走到相应位置才出现的感受也更容易和当下声音对上；即使没读过原文，我也能迅速看懂“想靠近—怕负担—试着靠近—被看见—确认没被推开—开始盼以后—怕失去—最后不再往回藏”这一条连续的心理线。X的因果其实写得很全，但完整长句和右侧短词同时争注意力，几秒内更容易变成知道很多局部意思，却来不及抓住这一段最重要的转折；Y的感受也更常落到呼吸、失重、发酸、悬住、松开等具体身体和声音变化上，所以细腻度更高。\"}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b5a0aeef-0940-43a0-bc93-54b2fe92a233", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T043828156667Z", "elapsed_seconds": 9.953, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T04:38:38.116993+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "91ec3943e6a56a74b0771973a6186580a1fbf852926c94dd7886e20ccba563f3", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f